@host = http://localhost:5200

### Server -> 200
GET {{host}}/

### Bat tay -> 200 connectionId + WebSockets/SSE/LongPolling
POST {{host}}/hubs/ping/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### Goi hub nhu REST, thieu ConnectionId -> 400
GET {{host}}/hubs/ping

### Sai duong dan -> 404
POST {{host}}/hub/ping/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1
